# Wake-fleet scripts

- Import bots from `roster.ts` (`rosterBots`, `findBot`, `resolveCommand`, `writeAssignment`). A pasted name table is a bug.
- `fleet-status.ts` may read grind logs only for intervene heuristics (repeat lines, recovery ×20, pathfinding bursts, Musa ship). Job identity is `resolveCommand`, not regex on log text.
- `grindTail` must stay a bounded tail read. Do not `readFileSync` the whole log.
- On observing a live bun process or starting a launch agent, write `assignment.json`. `runScript` and `ActivitySession` (`grindLogPath` set) also write it. Do not invent a fourth command source. Do not bring back `inferCommand()`.
- `watch-fleet.sh` panes come from `roster.ts tmux`. Do not hardcode Jackpoo / ABGARMY towers again.
- `install` / `restart` must rewrite plists from the current roster; keep installed argv in lockstep with `roster.json`.
- Grind appends go through `appendGrindLog` (`sdk/grind-log.ts`). `ActivitySession.log` already does. Do not switch it back to unbounded `appendFileSync`.
